    "detailed_description": "<h1>Highlights</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our primary goal in the game is to find the scientist and get information from him. However, we suspect that the scientist is dead due to the events that have developed and we continue the adventure, hoping that he left a clue behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is that he left an antidote to destroy the evil he created. In this adventure, you will experience various puzzle, horror and action elements while trying to save the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/11242c26553a14d4ddeca018479e8ba0.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image1.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/9ae4466538a5c0f3f71fdc34f25c1b73.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span>You can use many objects to solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image2.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/8afd787ab80ee5fb1fddd87e6e15dd66.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>Get ready to be scared as you unravel the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image3.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/0a73fa0702953a50023e2b6996b308e3.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>Get ready for a gripping story full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image4.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our primary goal in the game is to find the scientist and get information from him. However, we suspect that the scientist is dead due to the events that have developed and we continue the adventure, hoping that he left a clue behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is that he left an antidote to destroy the evil he created. In this adventure, you will experience various puzzle, horror and action elements while trying to save the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/11242c26553a14d4ddeca018479e8ba0.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image1.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/9ae4466538a5c0f3f71fdc34f25c1b73.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span>You can use many objects to solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image2.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/8afd787ab80ee5fb1fddd87e6e15dd66.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>Get ready to be scared as you unravel the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image3.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/0a73fa0702953a50023e2b6996b308e3.avif?t=1752339563\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>Get ready for a gripping story full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210750/extras/image4.jpg?t=1752339563\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p>",
